eplacementImageBound}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S\\)</span> 保留；十二参数版本显式携带同一个模型、语言、语义关系、变量码和赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S(C,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\land C\\subseteq B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S(C,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\land C\\subseteq B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical bounded-replacement instance returns the exact image <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> of the functional formula, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq B\">\\(C\\subseteq B\\)</span> states precisely that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> bounds that image.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance","status":"resolved","id":"2a8aeae215f43282","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,A,\\varphi,p,\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S","display":false},{"tex":"(C,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S(C,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\land C\\subseteq B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10ReplacementImageBound}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3392","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set10-replacement-image-bound.md|58-df-